[Narrator]欢迎来到猴子健康中心，医生们专业又热情——就是病人有点离谱。
{Bai}{FaceRelaxed}{CrossArms}
{Wen}{FaceProud}{NoseTwitch}
{Cheng}{FaceRelaxed}{SlowNod}
{Lan}{FaceAngry}{Flex}

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,600
{SFX:Play|name=whoosh_fast}
{Position:XiaoMi|x=6.0|y=0.01|z=0.0|face=center}
{Event:Move|character=XiaoMi|x=1.5|z=0.0|duration=1.8|action=Run}
[XiaoMi]{FaceSad}{PanicWave}医生！医生！我快不行了！

3
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:12,292
{Camera:TwoShot|characterA=XiaoMi|characterB=Bai|distance=4.5|height=2.2}
[Bai]{FaceDetermined}冷静，慢慢说，哪里不舒服？

4
00:00:14,432 --> 00:00:17,010
[XiaoMi]{FaceSad}{HoldBelly}我……我吃了香蕉皮，肚子在造反！

5
00:00:18,314 --> 00:00:21,899
{Camera:CloseUp|target=Bai|distance=4.0|heightOffset=0.0|sideAngle=-20}
[Bai]{FaceConfused}{MagnifyInspect}吃香蕉皮？这需要仔细观察。

6
00:00:21,999 --> 00:00:25,536
{Camera:CloseUp|target=Wen|distance=4.0|heightOffset=0.1|sideAngle=20}
[Wen]{FaceProud}{NoseTwitch}让我闻闻！我的鼻子从不误判！

7
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:29,073
{Camera:TwoShot|characterA=Wen|characterB=XiaoMi|distance=4.0|height=2.0}
[Wen]{FaceSurprised}嗯……有香蕉味，还有一点点……紧张味？

8
00:00:29,073 --> 00:00:31,334
[XiaoMi]{FaceConfused}我紧张是因为吃多了……

9
00:00:32,087 --> 00:00:35,587
{Camera:CloseUp|target=Wen|distance=4.0|heightOffset=0.1|sideAngle=20}
[Wen]{FaceProud}那就对了！你这是吃多了香蕉皮！

10
00:00:35,587 --> 00:00:39,747
{Camera:CloseUp|target=Bai|distance=4.0|heightOffset=0.0|sideAngle=-20}
[Bai]{FaceAnnoyed}他确实吃多了，但症状不严重。
{Wen}{FaceConfused}哦……那是我诊断得太快了？

11
00:00:39,747 --> 00:00:43,747
{Camera:CloseUp|target=Cheng|distance=4.0|heightOffset=0.1|sideAngle=-15}
[Cheng]{FaceRelaxed}{Shrug}让我来做腹部舒缓操，我手很轻。

12
00:00:43,747 --> 00:00:47,747
{Camera:Static|position=0,3.5,8.0|lookAt=2,1.0,0}
[Cheng]{FaceDetermined}{Flex}一下就好！
{Event:Move|character=XiaoMi|x=3.5|z=0.5|duration=0.6|action=Run}
{SFX:Play|name=whoosh_fast}

13
00:00:47,747 --> 00:00:52,081
{Camera:CloseUp|target=XiaoMi|distance=4.0|heightOffset=0.0|sideAngle=0}
[XiaoMi]{FaceScared}{HoldBelly}啊！肚子咕噜咕噜响！

14
00:00:52,081 --> 00:00:55,581
{Camera:CloseUp|target=Cheng|distance=4.0|heightOffset=0.1|sideAngle=-15}
[Cheng]{FaceHappy}{SlowNod}看，肠胃开始运动了。

15
00:00:55,581 --> 00:00:59,669
{Camera:CloseUp|target=Lan|distance=4.0|heightOffset=0.0|sideAngle=-15}
[Lan]{FaceAngry}{Intimidate}轮到我了。深呼吸，放松肩膀。

16
00:00:59,669 --> 00:01:01,869
{Camera:Static|position=-0.8,3.0,9.0|lookAt=-0.8,1.2,-0.25}
[Lan]{FaceAngry}{Stare}

17
00:01:01,869 --> 00:01:05,091
[XiaoMi]{FaceScared}你、你别瞪我……我更紧张了！

18
00:01:05,091 --> 00:01:08,591
{Camera:CloseUp|target=Lan|distance=4.0|heightOffset=0.0|sideAngle=-15}
[Lan]{FaceConfused}奇怪，平时一瞪大家就笑了。

19
00:01:08,591 --> 00:01:12,591
{Camera:CloseUp|target=Bai|distance=4.0|heightOffset=0.0|sideAngle=-20}
[Bai]{FaceDetermined}{PointForward}诸位，这个病例需要综合会诊。

20
00:01:12,591 --> 00:01:16,823
{Camera:Static|position=0,3.5,8.0|lookAt=0,1.2,0}
[Bai]{FaceDetermined}闻多多闻，橙大力按，蓝凶凶带大家放松，我负责记录。
{Wen}{FaceHappy}{NoseTwitch}
{Cheng}{FaceRelaxed}{Flex}
{Lan}{FaceAngry}{DramaticPose}

21
00:01:16,823 --> 00:01:20,823
{Camera:CloseUp|target=XiaoMi|distance=4.0|heightOffset=0.0|sideAngle=0}
[XiaoMi]{FaceScared}等等，综合是什么意思？

22
00:01:20,823 --> 00:01:24,823
{Camera:Static|position=0,4.0,9.0|lookAt=1,1.0,0}
{Wen}{FaceProud}{Sniff}
{Cheng}{FaceDetermined}{ReachOut}
{Lan}{FaceAngry}{Intimidate}
{SFX:Play|name=whoosh_fast}
[XiaoMi]{FaceScared}啊——！

23
00:01:24,823 --> 00:01:27,663
{Camera:CloseUp|target=Bai|distance=4.0|heightOffset=0.0|sideAngle=-20}
[Bai]{FaceConfused}停！病人脸色好多了。

24
00:01:27,663 --> 00:01:29,885
[XiaoMi]{FaceCry}{HoldBelly}我感觉……要打嗝了！

25
00:01:29,885 --> 00:01:31,936
{Camera:CloseUp|target=Wen|distance=4.0|heightOffset=0.1|sideAngle=20}
[Wen]{FaceWorried}我的诊断是不是要成真了？

26
00:01:31,936 --> 00:01:33,936
[Bai]{FaceAnnoyed}你还没有正式诊断。

27
00:01:33,936 --> 00:01:39,920
{Camera:TwoShot|characterA=Bai|characterB=XiaoMi|distance=4.0|height=2.0}
[Bai]{FaceDetermined}从逻辑分析：吃多了香蕉皮，肚子胀，运动完打嗝……

28
00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:43,420
{Camera:CloseUp|target=Bai|distance=4.0|heightOffset=0.0|sideAngle=-20}
[Bai]{FaceSurprised}真相只有一个！

29
00:01:43,420 --> 00:01:47,420
{Camera:CloseUp|target=Bai|distance=4.0|heightOffset=0.0|sideAngle=-20}
[Bai]{FaceSmirk}你只是需要打个嗝。

30
00:01:47,420 --> 00:01:51,420
{Camera:CloseUp|target=XiaoMi|distance=4.0|heightOffset=0.0|sideAngle=0}
[XiaoMi]{FaceConfused}什么？

31
00:01:51,420 --> 00:01:55,420
{Camera:Static|position=0,3.5,8.0|lookAt=1,1.0,0}
{Bai}{FaceDetermined}{ReachOut}
[XiaoMi]{FaceSurprised}啊！真的！

32
00:01:55,420 --> 00:01:59,420
{Camera:CloseUp|target=XiaoMi|distance=4.0|heightOffset=0.0|sideAngle=0}
[XiaoMi]{FaceHappy}好了！我完全好了！

33
00:01:59,420 --> 00:02:03,420
{Camera:CloseUp|target=Wen|distance=4.0|heightOffset=0.1|sideAngle=20}
[Wen]{FaceProud}我就说和香蕉有关吧。

34
00:02:03,420 --> 00:02:07,420
{Camera:CloseUp|target=Bai|distance=4.0|heightOffset=0.0|sideAngle=-20}
[Bai]{FaceSmirk}{CrossArms}没事就好。诊费：三根香蕉。

35
00:02:07,420 --> 00:02:10,920
{Camera:CloseUp|target=XiaoMi|distance=4.0|heightOffset=0.0|sideAngle=0}
[XiaoMi]{FaceShocked}三根香蕉？！我就打了个嗝！

36
00:02:10,920 --> 00:02:14,420
{Camera:CloseUp|target=Cheng|distance=4.0|heightOffset=0.1|sideAngle=-15}
[Cheng]{FaceHappy}{SlowNod}还要加运动指导费。

37
00:02:14,420 --> 00:02:17,920
{Camera:CloseUp|target=Lan|distance=4.0|heightOffset=0.0|sideAngle=-15}
[Lan]{FaceAngry}再加放松课程费。

38
00:02:18,018 --> 00:02:22,018
{Camera:CloseUp|target=XiaoMi|distance=4.0|heightOffset=0.0|sideAngle=0}
[XiaoMi]{FaceScared}我没带那么多香蕉！我回家拿！

39
